WEBVTT

00:00:05.156 --> 00:00:09.117
MAN: ♪ Morning is breaking
WOMAN: ♪ Darkness is fading

00:00:09.160 --> 00:00:13.077
BOTH: ♪ We found
a way to the light

00:00:13.121 --> 00:00:17.038
♪ It's such a beautiful sight

00:00:19.127 --> 00:00:22.739
MAN: ♪ Any time, anywhere,
Turn around
and I'll be there

00:00:22.783 --> 00:00:27.135
♪ To shine, shine your way

00:00:27.178 --> 00:00:29.093
WOMAN: ♪ Like a star
burning bright

00:00:29.137 --> 00:00:30.878
♪ Lighting up
your darkest night

00:00:30.921 --> 00:00:35.099
♪ I'll shine, shine your way

00:00:35.143 --> 00:00:38.668
♪ Now I can see
MAN: ♪ You are the one

00:00:38.712 --> 00:00:42.672
♪ Sent here to
show me the way

00:00:42.716 --> 00:00:48.156
BOTH: ♪ All of our tears
will dry faster in the sun

00:00:49.026 --> 00:00:50.854
♪ Starting today

00:00:50.898 --> 00:00:53.204
♪ Shine, shine, shine

00:00:53.248 --> 00:00:54.902
♪ We're on our way

00:00:54.945 --> 00:00:59.080
♪ Shine, shine, shine
That's why we say

00:00:59.123 --> 00:01:02.431
♪ Shine, shine, shine

00:01:02.474 --> 00:01:04.999
♪ Shine your way

00:01:05.042 --> 00:01:08.698
♪ There's a reason why
you shine

00:01:08.742 --> 00:01:11.309
♪ Shine your way

00:01:11.353 --> 00:01:16.576
♪ All of our tears
will dry faster in the sun

00:01:16.619 --> 00:01:19.187
♪ Shine your way

00:06:14.438 --> 00:06:16.440
[TRUMPETING MARIACHI MUSIC]

00:06:20.401 --> 00:06:21.532
[TRUMPETS]
